            "Vary trend vocabulary: surged, expanded, climbed, retrenched instead of simple 'went up' or 'went down'.",
            "Use a structural overview describing the macro-trend in your overall sentence.",
            "Group similar trends together — growing lines in one paragraph, declining lines in another.",
