            {"sentence": "Young people use phones too much.", "band": "Band 7", "improved": "Excessive screen use can interfere with sleep, study and physical activity.", "tip": "Explain the consequences."},
            {"sentence": "Social media has bad information.", "band": "Band 7", "improved": "Social platforms can expose inexperienced users to misleading or unreliable information.", "tip": "Use precise nouns."},
            {"sentence": "Teenagers compare themselves with others.", "band": "Band 8", "improved": "Constant exposure to idealised online lifestyles may encourage unhealthy social comparison.", "tip": "Use a cause-and-effect structure."},
            {"sentence": "Social media is not always bad.", "band": "Band 8", "improved": "The impact of social media ultimately depends on whether users engage with it responsibly or compulsively.", "tip": "Add nuance."},
